  "equipment_type": "Thermal (BTU) energy meter",
  "applies_to": "Belimo Thermal Energy Meters version 4, DN 15 to 50 (22PE..-1U.., including MID-certified 22PEM models).",
  "summary": "The Belimo Thermal Energy Meter combines an ultrasonic flow sensor with supply and return temperature sensors to measure heating and cooling power and energy in hydronic circuits. It offers BACnet MS/TP and BACnet IP (with foreign-device registration). It is a read-only metering device apart from unit selection, meter-register choice and the extra sensor input settings.",
  "bacnet_transport": [
    "BACnet IP",
    "BACnet MS/TP"
  ],
  "firmware": "Application 04.02.0000, firmware 14.10.0002",
  "default_device_instance": 1,
  "access_inferred": false,
  "notes": [
    "The document prints access as R / W; those objects are listed here as writable (W).",
    "Units of flow, power, energy, volume and temperature objects follow the unit-select MVs 123-127.",
    "MV 200 picks the certified register (MID models 22PEM only) or the lifetime register; energy and volume objects follow it.",
    "Sensor 1 objects (AI 20/21, AV 20, BI 20) are out of service unless MV 220/221 select the matching sensor type.",
    "Value ranges depend on pipe size (DN)."
  ],
  "integration": {
    "summary": "Set the units once (MV 123-127), then read heating and cooling power and energy, flow and the two temperatures. Use the PIV energy objects if the BMS prefers integer totals. Watch MV 99 and AV 140 for faults.",
